{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1385641-chance-of-getting-an-updated-version-of-requiem","id":1385641,"title":"Chance of getting an updated version of Requiem?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-04T13:06:51-07:00","id":1385641,"title":"Chance of getting an updated version of Requiem?","content":"So, now that pretty much all of the splat books have been updated to 2e, what are the chances of us getting an updated version of Requiem? Maybe not a full on 3e version, but something like a 2.5 version, or a Revised Requiem, or something. I mean Requiem 2e is, what, more than 15 years old now? There's tons of stuff in dire need of updating, modification, and clarification. Rose Bailey was already working on an unofficial update for Requiem (what happened to that anyway), so why not just make it official.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13542-shadowdragon","name":"Shadowdragon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T13:18:19-07:00","id":1385642,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowdragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1385641-chance-of-getting-an-updated-version-of-requiem#post1385641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean Requiem 2e is, what, more than 15 years old now?</div> </div> </div> </div>...Requiem <i>1e</i> is fifteen going on sixteen. 2e Core came out less than <i>seven</i> years ago.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T13:31:52-07:00","id":1385645,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowdragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1385641-chance-of-getting-an-updated-version-of-requiem#post1385641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, now that pretty much all of the splat books have been updated to 2e, what are the chances of us getting an updated version of Requiem? Maybe not a full on 3e version, but something like a 2.5 version, or a Revised Requiem, or something. I mean Requiem 2e is, what, more than 15 years old now? There's tons of stuff in dire need of updating, modification, and clarification. Rose Bailey was already working on an unofficial update for Requiem (what happened to that anyway), so why not just make it official.</div> </div> </div> </div>6.5 years; 2E was released at the tale end of 2013. Requiem itself is about 15/16.<br /> <br /> I'm biased, but I think VTR 2E runs the best of all the 2E games -- Demon is the other, but it's sometimes too fussy with modifiers, and angels need a rewrite, so Requiem edges it out. There are certainly a few things I'd want to see cleaned up (make Clash of Wills more universal like the other lines, simplify the Blood Sorcery system a tad), but I've not found it to show its age too much. I'm playing a 2E game right now and it's still a lot of fun. The Disciplines continue to be my favourite in any iteration of either Vampire game.<br /> <br /> That said, I wouldn't hate to see a blood pool system more akin to V5, where the total is more abstract, but that's something for a hypothetical 3rd edition. Honestly, there's much more in the core CofD system I'd like rejiggered than Requiem in particular. To answer your question, there are little changes that could be made, but there always are, and I think it would be more likely (depending on the license holder, of course) to see a new edition at some point in the future, rather than a 2.5. I'm not sure what Rose's plans were/are, but she mostly does her own RPG work these days.<br /> <br /> Although, if OPP decided to ever do a Kickstarter for a prestige version of the core, then we could talk about a few tweaks...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}